      "title": "Laughs, Pizza &#038; Shots – English Comedy Night in the Heart of Berlin!",
      "description": "<p><script\n  src=\"https://www.universe.com/embed2.js\"\n  data-widget-type=\"universe-ticket\"\n  data-target-type=\"time-slots\"\n  data-target-id=\"J7CKLT\"\n  data-state=\"buttonColor=%233A66E5&#038;buttonText=Get%20Tickets\" >\n</script></p>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"5khai-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"5khai-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"5khai-0-0\">Where history meets punchlines!</span><span data-offset-key=\"5khai-0-1\"> Cosmic Comedy Berlin is one of the city&#8217;s most popular shows and the longest-running English-language </span><span data-offset-key=\"5khai-0-2\">comedy club</span><span data-offset-key=\"5khai-0-3\">, hosted inside a stunning old bank building in the heart of Berlin.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"517be-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"517be-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"517be-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-0\">Every event features a rotating lineup of</span><span data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-1\"> international and local comedians</span><span data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-2\">, free </span><span data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-3\">vegetarian and vegan pizza</span><span data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-4\"> and </span><span data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-5\">apple shots</span><span data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-6\"> before the show, and a friendly, international crowd that makes everyone </span><span data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-7\">feel at home</span><span data-offset-key=\"9rj1a-0-8\">.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"6dkp0-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"6dkp0-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"6dkp0-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"2e5ng-0-0\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"cohfg-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"cohfg-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"cohfg-0-0\">Showcase Night</span><span data-offset-key=\"cohfg-0-1\"> – international and local comedians at their best</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"193hb-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"193hb-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"193hb-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"5p8m8-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"5p8m8-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"5p8m8-0-0\">Whether you’re living in Berlin or just visiting, Cosmic Comedy is the perfect night out — blending history, comedy, and positive vibes.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"aoqil-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"aoqil-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"aoqil-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"ff9a6-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"ff9a6-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"ff9a6-0-0\">Host: </span><a href=\"https://dharmandersingh.com/\"><span data-offset-key=\"ff9a6-1-0\">Dharmander Singh</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"b471q-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"b471q-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"b471q-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"b3oki-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"b3oki-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"b3oki-0-0\">★★★★★ OPENING TIMES ★★★★★</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"bkkdv-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"bkkdv-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"bkkdv-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"8gb16-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"8gb16-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"8gb16-0-0\">Doors: 19:00</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"9jr2u-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"9jr2u-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"9jr2u-0-0\">Pizza: 20:15</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"504s6-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"504s6-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"504s6-0-0\">Show: 21:00</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"822pg-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"822pg-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"822pg-0-0\">2for1 drinks selection: between 19:00 and 20:00</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1fcoh\" data-offset-key=\"27t3e-0-0\"></div>",
