      "title": "TURBOPAOLO &#8211; IL POLIZIOTTO DEL FORMAGGIO 2026",
      "description": "<p>Originally Paolo Sarmenghi, TURBOPAOLO is one of the most distinctive digital comedians of his generation, known for turning everyday irony into a unique and immediate language. Overthinking, marketing techniques, dreams of glory, ads, dolphins, and everything the internet can spark in our minds are just some of the recurring themes in his sketches — all shaped through his unmistakable perspective. His style is unpredictable and deeply connected to the way we observe the world today: a mental feed you can get lost in for hours, which in recent years has also found a new dimension on stage. After building a strong following online, TURBOPAOLO brought his comedy to live audiences with a stand-up show that preserves the same energy, now enhanced by a more direct and impactful connection with the crowd. In 2025, he embarked on an extensive tour across several European cities, as well as throughout Italy, selling out multiple dates and strengthening his bond with audiences beyond the screen. Today, he continues to expand his comedic universe from digital platforms to live performance, with a style that is both recognizable and constantly evolving.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Tickets: <a href=\"https://www.eventim.de/noapp/event/turbopaolo-il-poliziotto-del-formaggio-cosmic-comedy-club-21953152/?affiliate=SZ3&amp;utm_campaign=SzeneTickets+GmbH&amp;utm_source=SZ3&amp;utm_medium=dp\">eventim.de</a></p>",
